## 2. Complete API Endpoint Inventory

Below is every endpoint the backend needs to serve, grouped by resource. Each row shows the HTTP method, path, auth requirement, and what it does.

### 2.1 Auth Endpoints — `/api/auth`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 1 | `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Public | Create account (username, email, password) |
| 2 | `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Authenticate → return JWT |
| 3 | `POST` | `/api/auth/logout` | 🔒 | Blacklist the current token (optional, client-side delete is simpler) |
| 4 | `GET` | `/api/auth/me` | 🔒 | Return the currently authenticated user's profile |

### 2.2 User / Profile Endpoints — `/api/users`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 5 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id` | Public | Get a user's public profile |
| 6 | `PUT` | `/api/users/:id` | 🔒 Owner | Update profile (bio, avatar, tagInterests) |
| 7 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id/posts` | Public | List a user's public posts (+ private if owner) |
| 8 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id/collections` | Public | List a user's public collections (+ private if owner) |

### 2.3 Follow Endpoints — `/api/follows`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 9 | `POST` | `/api/users/:id/follow` | 🔒 | Follow a user |
| 10 | `DELETE` | `/api/users/:id/follow` | 🔒 | Unfollow a user |
| 11 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id/followers` | Public | List followers of a user (paginated) |
| 12 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id/following` | Public | List who a user follows (paginated) |

### 2.4 Post Endpoints — `/api/posts`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 13 | `POST` | `/api/posts` | 🔒 | Create a new post (text, style, media, tags, visibility, isAnonymous) |
| 14 | `GET` | `/api/posts/:id` | Mixed | Get single post (public → open, private → owner-only) |
| 15 | `PUT` | `/api/posts/:id` | 🔒 Author | Edit a post |
| 16 | `DELETE` | `/api/posts/:id` | 🔒 Author | Delete a post (cascade: reactions, analytics, search_index, collection refs) |
| 17 | `POST` | `/api/posts/:id/repost` | 🔒 | Repost (creates new Post doc with `repostOf` pointing to original) |
| 18 | `POST` | `/api/posts/:id/comments` | 🔒 | Add a comment (embedded in post) |
| 19 | `DELETE` | `/api/posts/:id/comments/:commentId` | 🔒 Author/Comment-owner | Delete a comment |

### 2.5 Reaction Endpoints — `/api/reactions`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 20 | `POST` | `/api/posts/:id/reactions` | 🔒 | React to a post (like, love, etc.) — also `$inc` Post.reactionCount |
| 21 | `DELETE` | `/api/posts/:id/reactions` | 🔒 | Remove reaction — also `$inc` Post.reactionCount by -1 |
| 22 | `GET` | `/api/posts/:id/reactions` | Public | Get reaction summary for a post (aggregated counts by type) |

### 2.6 Collection Endpoints — `/api/collections`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 23 | `POST` | `/api/collections` | 🔒 | Create a new collection |
| 24 | `GET` | `/api/collections/:id` | Mixed | Get collection details + populated posts |
| 25 | `PUT` | `/api/collections/:id` | 🔒 Owner | Update collection (name, description, visibility) |
| 26 | `DELETE` | `/api/collections/:id` | 🔒 Owner | Delete a collection |
| 27 | `POST` | `/api/collections/:id/posts` | 🔒 Owner | Save a post into a collection — `$inc` Post.saveCount |
| 28 | `DELETE` | `/api/collections/:id/posts/:postId` | 🔒 Owner | Remove a post from collection — `$inc` Post.saveCount by -1 |

### 2.7 Tag & Discovery Endpoints — `/api/tags`, `/api/feed`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 29 | `GET` | `/api/tags` | Public | List all tags (with optional `?category=` filter) |
| 30 | `GET` | `/api/tags/trending` | Public | Top tags by `usageCount` |
| 31 | `GET` | `/api/tags/:slug/posts` | Public | Posts tagged with a specific slug (paginated) |
| 32 | `GET` | `/api/feed` | Public | Global explore feed (public + anonymous, sorted by recency/popularity) |
| 33 | `GET` | `/api/feed/following` | 🔒 | Personalized feed from followed users |
| 34 | `GET` | `/api/feed/trending` | Public | Top posts by reactionCount + saveCount in last 7 days |

### 2.8 Search Endpoint — `/api/search`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 35 | `GET` | `/api/search` | Public | Full-text search across posts (`?q=`, `?tag=`, `?type=`, `?user=`) — hits SearchIndex |

### 2.9 Analytics Endpoints — `/api/analytics`

| # | Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|--------|------|------|-------------|
| 36 | `POST` | `/api/analytics/events` | Mixed | Log an analytics event (view, click, share, save, report) |
| 37 | `GET` | `/api/posts/:id/analytics` | 🔒 Author | Get analytics summary for a post (views, saves, reactions, reach) |
| 38 | `GET` | `/api/users/:id/analytics` | 🔒 Owner | Get aggregate analytics across all of a user's posts |

