## 11. Postman Testing Checklist

Each group should be tested in order, as later groups depend on data from earlier ones.

### Group 1 — Auth
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Register with valid data | `201` + token + user object |
| Register with duplicate email | `409 Conflict` |
| Login with correct credentials | `200` + token |
| Login with wrong password | `401 Unauthorized` |
| `GET /me` with valid token | `200` + user |
| `GET /me` without token | `401` |

### Group 2 — Users
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Get profile by ID | `200` + public profile data |
| Update own profile | `200` + updated fields |
| Update someone else's profile | `403 Forbidden` |
| Get user's posts (as visitor) | Only public posts |
| Get user's posts (as owner) | All visibility levels |

### Group 3 — Posts
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Create post (public) | `201` + post object |
| Create post (anonymous) | `201` + `isAnonymous: true` |
| Get anonymous post as visitor | `authorId` stripped |
| Edit own post | `200` + updated content |
| Delete own post | `200` + cascaded deletes verified |
| Add comment | `200` + comment appears in post.comments |
| Repost | `201` + new post with `repostOf` set |

### Group 4 — Follows & Reactions
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Follow a user | `201` |
| Follow same user again | `409` (duplicate) |
| Unfollow | `200` |
| Self-follow | `400 Bad Request` |
| React to post | `201` + Post.reactionCount incremented |
| Remove reaction | `200` + counters decremented |
| Get reaction summary | `200` + `{ like: n, love: n, ... }` |

### Group 5 — Collections
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Create collection | `201` |
| Save post to collection | `200` + Post.saveCount incremented |
| Remove post from collection | `200` + counters decremented |
| Get private collection as non-owner | `403` |
| Delete collection | `200` |

### Group 6 — Feed, Tags & Search
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Explore feed | `200` + paginated public posts |
| Following feed (authenticated) | `200` + posts only from followed users |
| Trending feed | `200` + sorted by engagement score |
| List tags | `200` + tag array |
| Trending tags | `200` + sorted by usageCount |
| Search `?q=love` | `200` + matching posts |
| Search `?tag=nostalgia` | `200` + filtered results |

### Group 7 — Analytics
| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Log view event | `201` + Post.viewCount incremented |
| Get post analytics (as author) | `200` + `{ views, saves, reactions }` |
| Get post analytics (as non-author) | `403` |
| Get user analytics (as owner) | `200` + aggregated stats |

